{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronook is a relaxing astronomy game where you return to your late grandpa\u2019s study. Take up stargazing, astrophotography and discover cosmic wonders; all with a warm beverage at hand. Your study may be small, but through your telescope, a whole new cosmos is now within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.poster.avif?t=1771057316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.webm?t=1771057316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/c90ba0de9160e3241126616777708915.mp4?t=1771057316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore space at your own pace from the comfort of your snug study room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Map out <strong>magical constellations</strong> in star-mapping puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Use your star chart to find and <strong>photograph a variety of charming planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2604\ufe0f Keep tabs on the latest cosmic news - who knows what <strong>cosmic wonders</strong> you'll find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd2 Print your photos and fill up your <strong>stargazer\u2019s scrapbook</strong> with all your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Experience a quiet but personal\u00a0<strong>heartfelt narrative</strong> that unfolds as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.poster.avif?t=1771057316\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.webm?t=1771057316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503880/extras/d49876b65b0af1d6bfbd1c7a5654cdb8.mp4?t=1771057316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astronook is probably the game for you if you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have any interest in stargazing, space or astronomy\u00a0\ud83d\udd2d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the vibes and aesthetics of stargazing, stars and space \ud83c\udf19</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a relaxing experience to unwind from a long day\u00a0\u2615</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish Day 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/a4101cf864a5c2473ab40e6545f87e1b75d1b419.jpg"},{"name":"Finish Day 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/cd57a00dbaa044b5a388581d06aba748947abbd8.jpg"},{"name":"Finish Day 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/db5d9f15f5a2b5ad0e2e2d161b39fb731e168ff8.jpg"},{"name":"Finish Day 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/620358cad922fd66ada06f307c49529f9f8c46da.jpg"},{"name":"Finish Day 5 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/c4a601c872ee68f51d864bc2f1286df00e4c1924.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503880/96731564e45a93e733f6325832fcf95672f17c50.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Stargazer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/